  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Return of Displaced Population in Ninewa Plains and West Ninewa Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed intervention is rooted in IOM Iraq&#x2019;s evolving approach to stabilization and revitalization of communities, and offers a holistic integrated solution to the numerous challenges faced by recently retaken locations. The intervention is evidence-based as it is informed by IOM&#x2019;s own area specific mixed qualitative and quantitative applied research methods, in addition to DTM data.</narrative>
  </description>
